silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_09_diagram_atlas_sections_04_naturality_squares_atlas_concrete_anchor_8#mittensvetrecord77 silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensVetRecord77 is the running fixture vet record about Mittens (date, veterinarian, fees). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'VetRecord77', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
